  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government-to-Government Jordan Aqaba-Amman Water Desalination and Conveyance Project (AAWDCP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government-to-Government Jordan Aqaba-Amman Water Desalination and Conveyance Project supports the Government of Jordans efforts to expand access to safely managed drinking water and strengthen national water security. The activity will help advance Jordans largest desalination initiative, which is expected to produce up to 300 million cubic meters of desalinated Red Sea water annually and convey it from Aqaba to Amman and communities along the corridor.</narrative>
  </description>
